    "body": "P4 · effort:high · area:3d, area:ui - maintainer's own ask for the next cut. The Turn X+/Y+/... buttons must compose their rotation about the setup's own axes instead of the world axes: that changes the WCS orientation transform, hence the posted coordinates of everything in that setup - safety floor, at least effort:high. New behaviour with its pinned tests, no new algorithm.\n",
